// ============================================================
// IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
// ============================================================
// See docs/DB_SCHEMA_REVIEW_v5.0.md for complete implementation details
//
// 1. MySQL Triggers Required:
//    - SpinWallet: balance >= 0 (BEFORE UPDATE/INSERT)
//    - GroupMember: count <= 20 (BEFORE INSERT)
//    - Locket: capturedAt within 60s (BEFORE INSERT)
//    - CheckIn: auto-expiration EVENT (SCHEDULED)
//
// 2. Missing Indexes Summary:
//    - CheckIn: [userId, status, expiresAt] - CRITICAL
//    - Locket: [visibility, capturedAt] - CRITICAL
//    - Vote: [spinSessionId, value] - IMPORTANT
//    - Friendship: [status] - IMPORTANT
//
// 3. Data Type Fixes:
//    - RestaurantHours.openTime/closeTime: VARCHAR(5) not DateTime
//    - SpinWallet.balance: BigInt not Int
//    - SpinLog.amount: BigInt not Int
//    - Restaurant.lat/lng: Decimal(10,8)/Decimal(11,8) not Float
//    - Locket.lat/lng: Decimal(10,8)/Decimal(11,8) not Float
//
// 4. New Fields Added:
//    - User: phone, isOnboarded, lastActiveAt
//    - Restaurant: googlePlaceId, rating, phone
//    - GroupMember: invitedBy
//    - SpinSession: categoryFilter
//    - SpinWallet: version
//    - Locket: exifStripped
//    - CheckIn: verificationMethod, accuracy
//    - SpinSessionCandidate: NEW TABLE (replaces candidateIds JSON)
//
// 5. Soft Deletes:
//    - User.deletedAt
//    - Restaurant.deletedAt
//    - Group.deletedAt
